    <string name="discord_step3_content">Pēhi i tō koutua (i raro i tō ingoa kaiwhakamahi) ka waiho i Pēwhārangi, Kaorei mahi rānei, kāore rānei e whakapono. ⚠️ Aua e whakamahi i Korehe — Discord ka huna i te mahi a Kizzy ina e huna koe.</string>
    <string name="discord_setup_title">I mua i te timatanga</string>
    <string name="console_auto_detect">Auto-tautohu DroidDeck / Eden</string>
    <string name="console_detected_hint">Pēhi ki te whakamahi i tēnei kēmu mō Console RPC</string>
    <string name="discord_step2_content">Kimihanga te "Tiritiri i tō mahi" ka whakapuhi. I raro i te "Kei hea koe e tiritiri i tō mahi", whiriwhiri te "Tiritiri ki ngā server katoa". Rerero ki te "Ōku server" ka whakapuhi ngā server e hiahia ana kia kitea tō koutua.</string>
    <string name="discord_tip_content">He pata o ngā putanga pūkokore o Discord ka huna i tēnei hihere. Whakatuwherahia discord.com i Chrome → whakapuhi te "Pūrere tūranga" → tomohia → Tītara (⚙️) → Privateness o te mahi → whakapuhi te "Tiritiri i tō mahi".</string>
    <string name="discord_setup_desc">Whakapono kua whakaae a Discord kia whakaatu i to mahi ki runga i tō kaupapa.</string>
    <string name="auto_detect_activity_type_desc">Ka tautohuhia ngā taiao puoro hei puoro, ngā taiao ataata hei ataata, nā reira YouTube Music kore ai e whakaaturua hei kēmu. Ko te huinga e kua whiriwhiri mō ngā taiao kotahi tonu e whai mana.</string>
