    <string name="discord_step1_content">Whakatuwherahia te taiao Discord → pēhi ki tō tohu "Koe" (whakaahua o tō kaupapa) → pēhi ki Tītara (⚙️) → rero ki raro ka pēhi ki te "Ihirangi me te Whatunga Pāpāho" (rānei te "Privateness o te mahi" i ngā putanga tawhito).</string>
    <string name="activity_type_fallback_desc">Ka whakamahia mō ngā taiao kāore i tautohuhia, mō ia taiao katoa ina ritea te tautohu aunoa.</string>
